title: route_combat_win
---
Wing Commander: Enemy fleet intercepted en route. They never reached the system.
Tactical: Hostile transit destroyed. Our fleet continues on course.
Fleet Commander: Mid-route engagement. We cut them off.
Pilot: Got them in open space. Fleet pressing forward.
===

title: route_combat_lose
---
Wing Commander: Our transit group was intercepted. They're gone.
